# Command Generation

Generate thin commands that reference rule files.

## Command Lists

AlwaysIncludeCommands { /help, /plan, /task, /review, /commit, /explain, /debug }

CommandsByContext {
  TeamTool+ => /discover, /execute, /log
  MVP+ => /feature, /journey
  BusinessRisk+ => /security-review
}

CommandDescriptions {
  /help => "List commands and agents"
  /plan => "Review plan, suggest next steps"
  /task => "Create epic, decompose into tasks"
  /review => "Code review"
  /commit => "Commit with conventional format"
  /explain => "Explain code or concept"
  /debug => "Debug issue"
  /discover => "Product discovery"
  /execute => "Execute task/epic"
  /log => "Log changes"
  /feature => "Plan and implement feature"
  /journey => "Map user journey"
  /security-review => "Security audit"
}

## Command-Rule Mapping

CommandRules {
  /task => rules/task-creator.mdc#createTask
  /execute => rules/task-creator.mdc#executeTask
  /review => rules/review.mdc#reviewProcess
  /discover => rules/productmanager.mdc#discoverProcess
  /feature => rules/productmanager.mdc#featureProcess
  /journey => rules/productmanager.mdc#journeyProcess
  /log => rules/log.mdc#logProcess
  /security-review => rules/security.mdc#securityReviewProcess
  /plan => rules/task-creator.mdc#planProcess
  /commit => rules/core.mdc#commitProcess
  /explain => rules/core.mdc#explainProcess
  /debug => rules/core.mdc#debugProcess
  /help => rules/agent-orchestrator.mdc#helpProcess
}

## Generation Process

generateCommands(lifecycle, risk) {
  commands = AlwaysIncludeCommands
  (lifecycle >= TeamTool) => commands += CommandsByContext[TeamTool+]
  (lifecycle >= MVP) => commands += CommandsByContext[MVP+]
  (risk >= Business) => commands += CommandsByContext[BusinessRisk+]

  For each command => generate commands/${name}.md per commandTemplate
}

## Command Template

commandTemplate(name) {
  """
  ---
  description: ${CommandDescriptions[name]}
  ---

  # /${name}

  @${CommandRules[name]}
  """
}

Constraints {
  Commands are ultra-thin - frontmatter + title + rule reference only.
  No process logic in commands - delegate entirely to rules.
  Max 7 lines per command file.
}
